UnderwriteLoop — Hackathon Execution Plan

1. Product Summary

UnderwriteLoop is an agentic eval platform for loan approval policies.

It does not directly approve or reject real borrowers. Instead, it helps lending teams test and improve underwriting policies before deployment.

The system takes cleaned borrower/application data, runs policy evals, finds failures, uses agents to critique the policy, revises the policy, and loops until the policy meets risk and quality thresholds.

2. One-Line Pitch


UnderwriteLoop helps lending teams stress-test and improve loan approval policies using agentic eval loops powered by trusted data.



