18. Demo Script

Say:


Loan approval policies often fail on edge cases. A policy may reject safe young businesses, approve high-debt borrowers, or create too many manual reviews.

UnderwriteLoop uses Nexla-prepared borrower data and agentic eval loops to test underwriting policies before deployment.

The evaluator deterministically scores the policy. The agent analyzes failures, suggests bounded changes, and the loop retests until the policy reaches the target risk and pass-rate threshold.



